KONOHAGAKURE — "KONOHA 12" CONTACT SHEET (ROOKIE GENERATION + TEAM GUY)

For inter-team coordination on joint operations. All are of the current young generation of Leaf shinobi.

Team 7: Uzumaki Naruto, Uchiha Sasuke, Haruno Sakura — sensei Kakashi Hatake.
Team 8: Hyuga Hinata, Inuzuka Kiba (+ Akamaru), Aburame Shino — sensei Kurenai Yuhi.
Team 10: Yamanaka Ino, Nara Shikamaru, Akimichi Choji — sensei Asuma Sarutobi.
Team Guy: Rock Lee, Hyuga Neji, Tenten — sensei Might Guy.

Coordination notes: These twelve trained together at the Academy and are frequently combined for retrieval and defense operations (e.g., the Sasuke Retrieval squad drawn primarily from this generation). Route joint-op tasking through each team's jonin-sensei and the Mission Assignment Desk.
